{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "作息(2026-09-24):7 行(周一在上)× 24 列(0~23 点),按真人发言条数分五档(相对本人峰值,与热力图同一套色阶)。\n小时是采集机本地时间,不按手机时区重算。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "作息",
        "empty": "等待首次同步",
        "wd0": "一",
        "wd1": "二",
        "wd2": "三",
        "wd3": "四",
        "wd4": "五",
        "wd5": "六",
        "wd6": "日",
        "peak": "峰值 "
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "Weekly rhythm",
        "empty": "Not synced yet",
        "wd0": "M",
        "wd1": "T",
        "wd2": "W",
        "wd3": "T",
        "wd4": "F",
        "wd5": "S",
        "wd6": "S",
        "peak": "Peak "
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90",
        "_note": "作息(2026-09-24):7 行(周一在上)× 24 列(0~23 点),按真人发言条数分五档(相对本人峰值,与热力图同一套色阶)。"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色身份点:本包统一用 Claude 暖橙两档。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-94pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "33pt+0*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
        "w": "12pt",
        "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
        "text": "${@i18n.wd0}",
        "fontSize": "8pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentV": "1"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "33pt+1*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
        "w": "12pt",
        "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
        "text": "${@i18n.wd1}",
        "fontSize": "8pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentV": "1"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "33pt+2*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
        "w": "12pt",
        "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
        "text": "${@i18n.wd2}",
        "fontSize": "8pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentV": "1"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "33pt+3*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
        "w": "12pt",
        "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
        "text": "${@i18n.wd3}",
        "fontSize": "8pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentV": "1"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "33pt+4*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
        "w": "12pt",
        "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
        "text": "${@i18n.wd4}",
        "fontSize": "8pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentV": "1"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "33pt+5*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
        "w": "12pt",
        "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
        "text": "${@i18n.wd5}",
        "fontSize": "8pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentV": "1"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "33pt+6*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
        "w": "12pt",
        "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
        "text": "${@i18n.wd6}",
        "fontSize": "8pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentV": "1"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "forEach",
        "props": {
          "items": "${w.punch.cells}",
          "key": "_it",
          "index": "_i"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "30pt+${_it.x}*({parent.w}-42pt)/24",
            "y": "33pt+${_it.y}*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
            "w": "({parent.w}-42pt)/24-2pt",
            "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "2pt",
              "leftB": "2pt",
              "rightT": "2pt",
              "rightB": "2pt"
            },
            "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(${_it.l},0),#EEE4E0|#2A2522,if::(eq::(${_it.l},1),#FED7AA|#7C2D12,if::(eq::(${_it.l},2),#FDBA74|#9A3412,if::(eq::(${_it.l},3),#E8916B|#C15F3C,#EA580C|#E8916B))))]"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${w.punch.has},1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "30pt",
            "y": "33pt+0*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
            "w": "24*({parent.w}-42pt)/24-2pt",
            "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
            "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "2pt",
              "leftB": "2pt",
              "rightT": "2pt",
              "rightB": "2pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "30pt",
            "y": "33pt+1*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
            "w": "24*({parent.w}-42pt)/24-2pt",
            "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
            "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "2pt",
              "leftB": "2pt",
              "rightT": "2pt",
              "rightB": "2pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "30pt",
            "y": "33pt+2*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
            "w": "24*({parent.w}-42pt)/24-2pt",
            "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
            "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "2pt",
              "leftB": "2pt",
              "rightT": "2pt",
              "rightB": "2pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "30pt",
            "y": "33pt+3*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
            "w": "24*({parent.w}-42pt)/24-2pt",
            "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
            "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "2pt",
              "leftB": "2pt",
              "rightT": "2pt",
              "rightB": "2pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "30pt",
            "y": "33pt+4*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
            "w": "24*({parent.w}-42pt)/24-2pt",
            "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
            "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "2pt",
              "leftB": "2pt",
              "rightT": "2pt",
              "rightB": "2pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "30pt",
            "y": "33pt+5*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
            "w": "24*({parent.w}-42pt)/24-2pt",
            "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
            "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "2pt",
              "leftB": "2pt",
              "rightT": "2pt",
              "rightB": "2pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "30pt",
            "y": "33pt+6*({parent.h}-60pt)/7",
            "w": "24*({parent.w}-42pt)/24-2pt",
            "h": "({parent.h}-60pt)/7-2pt",
            "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "2pt",
              "leftB": "2pt",
              "rightT": "2pt",
              "rightB": "2pt"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "30pt+0*({parent.w}-42pt)/24+(({parent.w}-42pt)/24-2pt)/2-{hx0.w}/2",
        "y": "{parent.h}-24pt",
        "w": "-1",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "0",
        "fontSize": "8pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "id": "hx0"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "30pt+6*({parent.w}-42pt)/24+(({parent.w}-42pt)/24-2pt)/2-{hx6.w}/2",
        "y": "{parent.h}-24pt",
        "w": "-1",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "6",
        "fontSize": "8pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "id": "hx6"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "30pt+12*({parent.w}-42pt)/24+(({parent.w}-42pt)/24-2pt)/2-{hx12.w}/2",
        "y": "{parent.h}-24pt",
        "w": "-1",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "12",
        "fontSize": "8pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "id": "hx12"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "30pt+18*({parent.w}-42pt)/24+(({parent.w}-42pt)/24-2pt)/2-{hx18.w}/2",
        "y": "{parent.h}-24pt",
        "w": "-1",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "18",
        "fontSize": "8pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "id": "hx18"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.punch.peak}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-25pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.peak}${w.punch.peak}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "alignmentH": "2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "时效锚:右上角、与卡名同一基线、9pt、右对齐(卡片设计系统 §3)。",
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},${@i18n.empty})]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      }
    ]
  }
}